 "name_en": "Requisitioning (18J)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Requisitioning (18J)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6886217f342845f09f00b6ca02ed1dbc\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6886217f342845f09f00b6ca02ed1dbc__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item describes employee requisitioning activities. An employee creates a shopping cart for free text material. A purchase requisition is generated and converted to a purchase order. If the value exceeds certain criteria, the purchase order must be approved. When the employee receives the goods, they perform a goods receipt confirmation. Invoice receiving can then be performed.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6886217f342845f09f00b6ca02ed1dbc__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Create purchase requisition</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Access my purchase requisition (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Copy purchase requisition</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Make mass changes to purchase requisitions</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Purchase requisition items by accounting assignment (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve purchase requisition (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Monitor purchase requisition items (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Redistribute workload</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Convert purchase requisition to purchase order</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Approve purchase order (optional)</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Confirm goods receipt</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Create supplier invoice for single and multiple accounting assignment</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Release blocked supplier invoice</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6886217f342845f09f00b6ca02ed1dbc__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Configure flexible workflow based on business requirements</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Save central resources for employee requisitioning process</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>申请 (18J)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio6886217f342845f09f00b6ca02ed1dbc\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6886217f342845f09f00b6ca02ed1dbc__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目描述员工申请活动。员工为自由文本物料创建购物车。生成采购申请并将其转换为采购订单。如果值超过特定条件，则必须审批采购订单。员工收到货物后，执行收货确认。然后可以执行发票接收。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6886217f342845f09f00b6ca02ed1dbc__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">创建采购申请</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">访问我的采购申请（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">复制采购申请</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">对采购申请进行批量更改</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">按会计分配的采购申请项目（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批采购申请（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">监控采购申请项目（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">重新分配工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">将采购申请转换为采购订单</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">审批采购订单（可选）</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">确认收货</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为单个和多个会计分配创建供应商发票</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">释放冻结的供应商发票</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio6886217f342845f09f00b6ca02ed1dbc__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">根据业务需求配置灵活工作流</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为员工申请流程节省集中资源</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
